  "content": "# 游標擴充\n\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"預設\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/default.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"指向手\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/pointing_hand.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"抓取\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/grabbing.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"文字選取\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/ibeam.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"Shift\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/shift.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"忙碌\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/busy.gif\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"不允許\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/not_allowed.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"十字準心\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/crosshair.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"全方位調整大小\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_all.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"水平調整大小\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_ew.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"垂直調整大小\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_ns.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"西北-東南調整大小\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_nwse.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"東北-西南調整大小\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_nesw.png\" />\n\n用 Minecraft 主題的游標取代原本無聊的系統預設游標。\n\n在 1.21.9 版本對模組帶來許多重大變更之前，本模組原名為 [Minecraft Cursor](https://github.com/fishstiz/minecraft-cursor/blob/master/README.md)。\n\n## 📌 需求\n\n- 使用 Fabric 時：需安裝 Fabric API\n\n## ✨ 特色\n\n- 透過資源包自訂游標紋理。\n- 自訂動畫讓游標栩栩如生。\n- 包含適用於其他情境的額外游標形狀。\n- 透過 [**傳統模式**](https://fishstiz.github.io/minecraft-cursor-wiki/resource-pack/getting-started#all-cursors) 強化對各種 GUI 元素的游標邏輯。\n- 依喜好調整各項選項。前往模組畫面或「選項 › 控制 › 滑鼠設定 › 游標設定」。\n\n![cursors_extended](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/o5fhgLeQ/images/6d6d002908e179dbfe11096af85f1f9a37d71189.gif)\n\n## 🖌️ 製作資源包\n\n打造屬於你自己的資源包，在支援的平台上分享，並有機會在[此處](https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/resource-pack/showcase)展示！\n\n<a href=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/resource-pack/showcase\" target=\"_blank\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fishstiz/resources/refs/heads/main/cursors-extended/showcase.gif\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"展示區\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/bedrock-style-cursors\" target=\"_blank\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/dUA5FyFq/images/28f9504fa044c59491a1555494b3e579eec186a1.png\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"基岩版風格游標\"/>\n</a>\n\n---\n\n已經為 Minecraft Cursor v3 製作了資源包？使用 [**V3 轉換工具**](https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/tools/#v3-converter) 進行轉換。\n\n由此開始：https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/resource-pack/getting-started",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
